,"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, June to July ran 267% of normal and November to December fell to 72% of normal. Grid 12425 had its driest year in 1956, at 36% of normal.</p>"}
